  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formalization of Indigenous Peoples&#x2019; Municipalities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to establishing 16 indigenous &quot;municipalities&quot; in the Colombian part of the Amazon.
Outcome: 
Number of Indigenous Councils in Colombian Amazon effectively functioning as administrative and political authorities; already registered with the Ministry of Interior and/or managing state funds and other functions on par with municipalities.</narrative>
  </description>
